record exprim.jp2.buffer-pool-20261127/1 : observation {
    title "Byte-capped JP2 plane pooling cuts colour scan decode time 22-34% and grayscale up to 50%"
    state superseded
    scope [
        path "codecs/jp2lam/src/decode/**",
        path "codecs/jp2lam/src/dwt/**",
        path "src/image/jpx.rs",
        path "src/render_cpu/mod.rs"
    ]
    statement """
        Measured with `jp2lam`'s `decode_benchmark` (`Jp2Decoder::decode_into`, warm after one untimed warmup, best of 7 runs) on five real scanned-page JP2 codestreams before and after pooling Tier-1 subband planes and 9/7 + 5/3 streaming DWT buffers in `Jp2BufferPool` (128 MiB cap). Every output hash is unchanged:

        - 9.2 MP 3-component 9/7 RGB colour scan: 109.68 -> 72.45 ms at t=1 (-33.9%; dwt 17.46 -> 7.32 ms, finalize 36.79 -> 17.70 ms, tier1_block_output 5.77 -> 0.85 ms) and 40.65 -> 27.45 ms at t=4 (-32.5%).
        - 10.5 MP 3-component 9/7 RGB colour scan: 166.21 -> 129.17 ms at t=1 (-22.3%; dwt 19.19 -> 7.67 ms, finalize 43.24 -> 21.40 ms) and 58.44 -> 52.04 ms at t=4 (-10.9%).
        - Medium 3-component 9/7 RGB colour scan: 59.26 -> 46.22 ms at t=1 (-22.0%) and 23.32 -> 15.56 ms at t=4 (-33.3%).
        - Grayscale reversible 5/3 scan: 21.63 -> 14.95 ms at t=1 (-30.9%) and 11.56 -> 5.80 ms at t=4 (-49.9%).
        - Tier-1-dense grayscale scan: 147.26 -> 143.58 ms at t=1 (-2.5%; dwt 3.89 -> 1.53 ms) and 47.74 -> 44.76 ms at t=4 (-6.2%).

        On Windows, fresh allocations over ~1 MiB go directly to VirtualAlloc/VirtualFree: first touch faults zeroed OS pages into both the Tier-1 subband planes and the DWT prefix planes, and drop triggers TLB shootdowns across threads. Parking and reusing those planes under one byte-capped pool removes both costs while keeping idle retention bounded and releasable.
        """
    observed_at git:a426fa7d98ee1ff1749aa6c9178ad34ffa7d6554
    method command
    watches [
        "codecs/jp2lam/src/decode/pool.rs",
        "codecs/jp2lam/src/decode/reconstruct.rs",
        "codecs/jp2lam/src/decode/t1.rs",
        "src/image/jpx.rs"
    ]
    confidence high
    author "dk"
}

